    "saphyr_parser"
  ],
  "coverage_limit": "saphyr::Yaml::load_from_str (LoadableYamlNode) on local UTF-8 text with exactly one document required. saphyr's YamlLoader builds the Yaml tree from saphyr-parser events, copies the anchored node for aliases and resolves plain scalars into Scalar values itself (early_parse default); mappings are hashlink LinkedHashMaps in source order. saphyr-parser is also a selected path (yaml-rust lineage). Mapping keys must be strings for the typed tree and explicit tags are rejected by the harness. The schema-neutral controls do not test tags, merge keys, multi-document streams or YAML 1.1-only scalars.",
  "afl_monomorphization_shim": "src/events (parsarium_yaml_saphyr_events) only instantiates saphyr's YamlLoader<Yaml> and saphyr_parser::Parser; Rust compiles generic code into the instantiating crate, so without the shim the parser's scanner and parser were compiled into the uninstrumented harness crate. The shim is instrumented with the parser crates; the harness's tree builder and scalar typing stay uninstrumented.",
  "afl_disable_aslr": true,
  "afl_disable_aslr_reason": "saphyr's Mapping is a hashlink LinkedHashMap with hashbrown's foldhash RandomState, which seeds from process addresses rather than getrandom; once the monomorphization shim made the loader code instrumented, identical afl-showmap repeats differed. The overlay runs afl-showmap under setarch -R (ASLR disabled for the target). Parser source and replay output are unchanged."
